'''Kotatsu Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]] increases attack power and grants the ability to nullify [[Wave Attack]]s, but reduces attack speed. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

